   "title": "Downloads + requirements",
   "widgets_values": [
    "## Downloads + requirements\n\nClick the file name to download it. Put each file in the folder shown (inside `ComfyUI/models/`).\n\n| Folder | File (click = download) | Size |\n|---|---|---|\n| `diffusion_models/` | [capybara_v0.1.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Hunyuan-Video-1.5/resolve/main/split_files/diffusion_models/capybara_v0.1.safetensors) | 16.65 GB |\n| `text_encoders/` | [qwen_2.5_vl_7b_fp8_scaled.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Hunyuan-Video-1.5/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/qwen_2.5_vl_7b_fp8_scaled.safetensors) | 9.38 GB |\n| `text_encoders/` | [byt5_small_glyphxl_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Hunyuan-Video-1.5/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/byt5_small_glyphxl_fp16.safetensors) | 0.44 GB |\n| `vae/` | [hunyuanvideo15_vae_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Hunyuan-Video-1.5/resolve/main/split_files/vae/hunyuanvideo15_vae_fp16.safetensors) | 2.52 GB |\n| `clip_vision/` | [sigclip_vision_patch14_384.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Hunyuan-Video-1.5/resolve/main/split_files/clip_vision/sigclip_vision_patch14_384.safetensors) | 0.86 GB |\n\nThe text encoder is the fp8 copy (the template links the 16.58 GB bf16 `qwen_2.5_vl_7b.safetensors`; it also works if you already have it: pick it in the loader). There is no fp8 or GGUF copy of the Capybara model itself.\n\n**VRAM:** The Capybara file (16.65 GB) is bigger than a 12 GB card, so ComfyUI keeps part of it in system RAM. On the 24 GB lab card, capped to a 10 GiB budget, the whole GPU peaked at 11.0 GiB; the picture was identical and a run took 45-48 s instead of 39-41 s. Not verified on a 12 GB card. Plan on 32 GB+ system RAM (not measured).\n\n**Run on ComfyUI 0.45.3.** **No custom nodes.**\n\nLicence: MIT (Capybara, github.com/xgen-universe/Capybara). It is built on Tencent's HunyuanVideo 1.5 (Tencent Hunyuan Community licence).\n"
   ]
  }
